<li>Uses Claude Code in implementation, refactoring, testing, and legacy-code workflows; checks proposed changes against domain rules, architecture boundaries, tests, and review before delivery. Built <a href="https://conorbrown.orangecastle.net/projects/mega-desk">Mega Desk</a>, an internal agent harness integrating Claude Agent SDK and Codex CLI with Azure DevOps workflows.</li>
